  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) Status of nationally determined contributions, national mid-century strategies and NAPs communicated to the UNFCCC in 6 EaP countries; (ii) Level of institutional capacities in the six EaP countries for the implementation of the Paris Agreement; (iii) Level of alignment with EU acquis as provided by bilateral agreements with EU and in the framework of Energy Community Treaty; (iv) Level of mobilization of new climate finance resources by countries (including under NIF/NIP) since the start of the project, EUR.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2019">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">NA</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)Participation at study tour on MRV 
2)Submission of the developed NDC2 Document to UNFCCC
3)Develop a guideline on mainstreaming climate change into waste sector;
4) Legislative update of Government Decision no.1277 on Establishment and Functioning of National System for Monitoring and Reporting Greenhouse Gas Emissions
5) First phase of elaboration of LEDS 2030 update</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Successful participation of Moldova government representatives to study tour on February 17-21 in Austria, Vienna and CopenHagen;
2) Moldova the 4th country to submit NDC 2 to UNFCCC on March 4th, 2020
3)International company contracted for elaboration of guidelines on climate mainstreaming into waste sector, to be presented in 2021
4) National MRV System GD successfully updated
5) Process started on elaboration of LEDS 2030 update(September 2020), to be completed in 2021
5) 92,0 % of proposed budget delivery under challenging COVID restictions circumstances</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)EU Aquis transposed at the national level (ETS Directive, f-gases Regulation)
2)Climate change mainstreamed into 2 priority sectors: energy and waste. 
3)LEDS 2030 updated based on the 2nd NDC and alignment of the GHG emissions reduction targets between all national policy planning documents ensured.
4)Relevant institutions (Environmental Agency, MARDE, National Bureau of Statistics, etc) trained in implementing the MRV system.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
